        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>This tactical @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.equipment.Item.Starday Night Special]{Semi-Auto Pistol} is favored for its relatively cheap price given the benefits it provides. Detectives commonly upgrade their first Starday night special out of sentimentality.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Lucky Bullet</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> (concentrate, misfortune)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your Strike with the weapon was a critical failure</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Even though your bullet completely missed your target, it managed to hit something in such a way that it still foils their plans. The target of your Strike must roll twice and take the worse result on the next check it attempts during its next turn.</p>"
